Choose 1 to register, 2 to log in, or 3 to exit.


⚠️ Important Security Note

This is a beginner learning project, not a secure real-world login system. Passwords are saved as plain text in users.txt, so anyone who can read the file can see them. A real application should use an appropriate password-hashing method, protect stored data, and apply stronger authentication and account-lockout controls.


